      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָדוֹן</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.10\">Pv 22.10</a></sup> <strong>contenda, discórdia</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:7\" href=\"/Psalms.80.7\">Sl 80.7</a> + 9 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְיָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.18\">Pv 18.18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְ֯וָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.19\">Pv 18.19</a> + 7 vezes; contraído em <span dir=\"rtl\">מְדָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.19\">Pv 6.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.12\">Pv 10.12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדֳ֯נִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.14\">Pv 6.14</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְיְנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.13\">Pv 19.13</a>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>contenda, discórdia</em>, quase inteiramente em Pv:—<a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.19\">Pv 18.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.29\">Pv 23.29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.20\">Pv 26.20</a>; também <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.14\">Pv 17.14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רִיב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.10\">Pv 22.10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּין וְקָלוֹן</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ יִשָּׂא</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:3\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.3\">Hc 1.3</a> <em>surge a contenda</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ריב</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁלּח מ׳</span> <em>desencadear contenda</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.14\">Pv 6.14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.19\">Pv 6.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.28\">Pv 16.28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגָרֶה מ׳</span> <em>suscita contenda</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.18\">Pv 15.18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.25\">Pv 28.25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.22\">Pv 29.22</a>; note-se especialmente <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מִדְוָ֯נִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.21\">Pv 26.21</a> = <em>um homem contencioso, briguento;</em> mais frequentemente <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵשֶׁת מ׳</span> = <em>uma mulher contenciosa</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.9\">Pv 21.9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.24\">Pv 25.24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.15\">Pv 27.15</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵשֶׁת מ׳ וָכָ֑עַס</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.19\">Pv 21.19</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>objeto de contenda</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:7\" href=\"/Psalms.80.7\">Sl 80.7</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מָדוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.10\">Jr 15.10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ רִיב</span>).—Sobre <span dir=\"rtl\">מָדוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.20\">2Sm 21.20</a> Qere, ver I. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מִדָּה\" href=\"/BDB,_מִדָּה\" dir=\"rtl\">מִדָּה</a> sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, מִדָּה\" href=\"/BDB,_מִדָּה\" dir=\"rtl\">מדד</a>.",
